WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Subtitles by Valdir Neto.

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:08.174
Something’s coming.

00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:15.640
Something we may not
be able to deter.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:19.144
Before this day is done.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:23.940
We shall be faced with
an unthinkable decision.

00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:33.742
I’ve fought with many
warriors in my time.

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:37.537
They were far stronger

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.457
than all of us put together.

00:00:40.457 --> 00:00:41.791
And they died.

00:00:43.960 --> 00:00:45.462
They died facing enemies

00:00:47.162 --> 00:00:48.602
and threats

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:50.925
that scared me far less

00:00:52.051 --> 00:00:53.762
than this one.

00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:04.522
Everything that they
sacrificed will be for nothing

00:01:05.482 --> 00:01:07.108
if we do not stand together.

00:01:10.361 --> 00:01:12.614
Put aside your petty squabbles

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:17.744
and presume nothing except this.

00:01:18.953 --> 00:01:20.497
If you return,

00:01:21.831 --> 00:01:24.501
you will return as
brothers and sisters.

00:01:31.841 --> 00:01:32.842
But mark my words,

00:01:40.558 --> 00:01:41.559
we’re going to need

00:01:41.976 --> 00:01:43.061
a miracle.

00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:46.898
Hey, pal.

00:01:49.192 --> 00:01:50.985
It’s not possible.